'''Kyne's Peace''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|shout]] that calms [[Skyrim:Animals|animals]]. Affected creatures will not fight or flee. Additionally, affected creatures will be revealed by an effect similar to [[Skyrim:Aura Whisper|Aura Whisper]] for the duration of the shout.

